  "finding": "Exact Decimal /W survives file serialization. Installed MuPDF 1.28.2 load_cid_font reads W through pdf_array_get_int, whose pdf_to_int rounds floorf(real+0.5). Actual rendered glyph advances agree with 596, while the full master and get_char_widths API return 595.703125. The API result is therefore not the actual CID paint advance.",
